## Hardware

- Jetson Orin NX 16GB, hostname `yahboom`, SSH alias `jetson`, user `jetson`. USB gadget answers at `192.168.55.1`. This PC is `192.168.55.100`.
- No monitor on the board. `attach_desktop()` keeps an SSH X11 tunnel when `DISPLAY` is `localhost:NN` or `127.x:NN`. Otherwise it draws on the client X server. Mac: XQuartz and `ssh -Y jetson`.
- Ollama is the system service. Qwen loads on the GPU after the detectors are warm. Do not delete JetPack, CUDA, `/usr`, `/opt`, or `~/nvme0n1-gpt-before-expand.bin`.
- GPU percent in the window comes from `/sys/devices/platform/gpu.0/load`.

